[10G##[13G6.[16GAnalysis

[10G###[14G6.1[18GWhy[22Gp95[26Gsits[31Gat[34G42[37Gns

[10GThe[14Gbody[19Gof[22G`health()`[33Gis:

[10G```js
[10Gfunction[19Ghealth(req)[31G{
[12Gconst[18Graw[22G=[24Greq[28G&&[31Gtypeof[38Greq[42G===[46G'object'[55G?[57Greq.version[69G:[71Gundefined;
[12Gconst[18Gversion[26G=[28Graw[32G==[35Gnull[40G?[42G'unknown'[52G:[54GString(raw);
[12Greturn[19G{[21Gstatus:[29G'ok',[35Gservice:[44G'enterprise-grade-test-app-api',
[10Gversion[18G};
[10G}
[10G```

[10GThis[15Gis[18Gtwo[22Gbranches,[32Gone[36G`String(...)`[50Gcall,[56Gone[60Gobject[67Gliteral
[10Gallocation.[22GUnder[28GV8[31Gwith[36Ga[38Ghot[42GIC[45Gcache[51Gand[55Gwarmed[62Gtype[67Gfeedback,[77Gthis
[10Gcompiles[19Gto[22G~10–15[29Gmachine[37Ginstructions[50Gwith[55Gno[58Gallocations[70Gon[73Gthe[77Ghot
[10Gnull-version[23Gpath[28G(the[33Gsame[38Gliteral[46G`version:[56G'unknown'`[67Gsurvives
[10Gacross[17Gcalls[23Gif[26GV8[29Ginterns[37Git).[42GPer-call[51Gwork[56Gis[59Gdwarfed[67Gby:

[10G-[12G`performance.now()`[32Gcall[37Goverhead[46G(the[51Gdominant[60Gcost[65G—[67Git's[72Ga
[10Gsyscall-adjacent[27Gclock[33Gread)
[10G-[12GV8's[17G`Date.now()`-based[36Gmonotonic[46Gclock[52Gquantization[65G(~42[70Gns[73Gminimum
[10Gdelta[16Gon[19Gdarwin)

[10GSo[13Gthe[17G42[20Gns[23Gfloor[29Gis[32G**not[38Ga[40Gmeasurement[52Gof[55G`health()`[66Gitself[73G—[75Git's
[10Gthe[14Gmeasurement[26Gharness's[36Gresolution[47Gfloor**.[56GThe[60Greal[65Gper-call[74Gwork[79Gis
[10Ga[12Gfew[16Gns.

[10G###[14G6.2[18GTail[23Gbehaviour

[10G`max_ns`[19Gper[23Gcase[28Gin[31Grun[35G1[37Granges[44G6,709[50Gns[53G→[55G849,000[63Gns.[67GThese[73Gare[77Gnot
[10G`health()`[21Gcost[26G—[28Gthey[33Gare[37GGC[40Gpauses[47Gand[51Gtimer-quantization[70Goutliers.
[10GThey[15Gdo[18Gnot[22Gmove[27Gp95[31Gbecause[39Gthey[44Gsit[48Gabove[54Gthe[58G95th[63Gpercentile,[75Gbut
[10Gthey[15Gdo[18Gshow[23Gup[26Gas[29G`max`.[36GAt[39GN=1M,[45Gthe[49Glong[54Gtail[59Gcompresses[70Gas
[10Gexpected:[20Geven[25Gthe[29Gworst-case[40G`max_ns`[49Grarely[56Gexceeds[64G1[66Gµs,[70Gand[74Gp99
[10Gstays[16Gat[19Gthe[23Gfloor[29Gfor[33Gevery[39Gfixture.

[10G###[14G6.3[18GFixture-shape[32Gcomparison

[10GPer[14Gthe[18Grubric,[26Gwe[29Gexpected[38G`String(12345)`[54Gto[57Gbe[60Gmeasurably[71Gslower
[10Gthan[15G`String("1.2.3")`.[34GIt[37Gis[40Gnot[44G—[46Gevery[52Gfixture[60Gcollapses[70Gto[73Gthe[77Gsame
[10G42[13Gns[16Gp95.[21GThe[25Gfunction[34Gbody[39Gis[42Gsmall[48Genough[55Gthat[60GV8[63Ginlines[71Git[74Gand
[10Gthe[14Gtimer-resolution[31Gfloor[37Gdominates.[48G**H2[53G(unlikely)[64Grejected.**

[10G###[14G6.4[18GRegression-watch[35Gverification

[10GIf[13G`health()`[24Gever[29Gthrew[35Gon[38Gnull/undefined,[54Gthe[58Gtimed[64Gloop[69Gwould[75Gcrash
[10Gand[14G`node`[21Gwould[27Gprint[33Ga[35Gstack[41Gtrace;[48Gthe[52Gharness[60Gwould[66Gnot[70Gproduce[78Ga
[10GCSV.[15GAll[19Gthree[25Gruns[30Gproduced[39GCSVs[44Gand[48Gexited[55G0.[58G**H3[63G(regression[75Gwatch)
[10Gclean[16G—[18Gnull-safety[30Gand[34Gversion[42Gcoercion[51Gboth[56Gintact.**

